OL,3,AAudio reveals exchanges between Spain
OL,4,Atrain operators and drivers moments
OL,5,Abefore deadly crash
OL,6,
OL,7,FLeaked audio recordings that were
OL,8,Fpublished in Spanish media have
OL,9,Frevealed conversations between train
OL,10,Fdrivers and a control centre just
OL,11,Fminutes before a deadly crash on
OL,12,FWednesday morning, that has killed 69
OL,13,Fpeople.
OL,15,FOfficials are investigating the cause
OL,16,Fof the disaster, which occurred when a
OL,17,Ftrain from Madrid to Seville barrelled
OL,18,Finto a stationary train near Urda.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
